    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    the snap standard deduction of household_1 is 209.
    the snap countable earned income of household_1 is 1000.
    the work supplementation earned income of household_1 is 0.
    the child support deduction of household_1 is 0.
    the dependent care deduction of household_1 is 0.
    the medical deduction of household_1 is 0.
    the snap excess shelter deduction of household_1 is 204.5.
    the snap monthly household income of household_1 is 1000.
    q_snap_net_income expects answers ["the snap net income of household_1 is 386.5"].
    q_snap_net_income_pre_shelter expects answers ["the snap net income pre shelter of household_1 is 591"].

